# Existing .pert plans should normally be maintained through perttool commands; direct DSL editing bypasses goal/DAG owner-confirmation checks.
project KAFS_CURRENT:
  version 9
  title "KAFS v7 completion and release with physical power interruption untested"
  description |
    Accepted 2026-09-17 goal: complete v7 implementation, qualify software
    recovery and non-power real-media behavior, then release while explicitly
    disclosing that physical power-interruption behavior remains untested.
    This plan does not authorize release, deployment, cutover, or card writes.
    Physical power-interruption testing is retained as non-goal planning Work,
    with no edge to the finish. Software crash/process-stop recovery, journal
    durability, fsck agreement, and wear behavior remain on the goal path.
    The current v7 runtime is bounded. HRL write-path integration, delayed
    scan, operation coverage, and image-size-sensitive write-path locality
    are incomplete or unproven. The KINGMAX run stopped after five of twelve
    normal cases because of severe latency. Exact remaining operation scope,
    performance threshold, release identity and channel, and work estimates
    need review. Point ranges are low-confidence planning estimates, not a
    delivery forecast or authority to select an implementation wave.
  as_of 2026-09-17
  duration_unit point
  finish V7_RELEASED_WITH_POWERLOSS_UNTESTED

resource PRIMARY_STREAM:
  title "One KAFS implementation and qualification stream"
  capacity 1

resource INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_STREAM:
  title "Reviewer independent from the implementation operator"
  capacity 1

work PHYSICAL_POWER_INTERRUPTION_TEST:
  title "Non-goal task: physical power-interruption test"
  description |
    Retained for a separately authorized later investigation if an isolated
    reader-power apparatus and exact test scope become available. It is not
    required for v7 implementation 100 percent, non-power qualification, or
    release under the owner's 2026-09-17 decision. Its omission cannot prove
    physical power-loss durability. Any field incident response is separate.

work_order:
  PHYSICAL_POWER_INTERRUPTION_TEST

milestone CURRENT_V7_BASELINE:
  title "Bounded v7 runtime, tools, and software evidence observed"
  state reached

milestone MIGRATION_REHEARSAL_READY:
  title "v5-to-v7 offline migration and rollback rehearsal ready"
  state reached

milestone V7_COMPLETION_SCOPE_FIXED:
  title "Exact v7 implementation 100 percent contract accepted"

milestone V7_LOCAL_WRITE_PATH_QUALIFIED:
  title "Normal writes avoid repeated image-wide work with invariants proved"

milestone V7_HRL_AND_DELAYED_SCAN_COMPLETE:
  title "v7 runtime HRL and delayed scan conform to the accepted contract"

milestone V7_OPERATION_SURFACE_COMPLETE:
  title "Accepted v7 operation surface implemented without silent fallback"

milestone V7_INTEGRATION_READY:
  title "Implementation branches and migration path ready for proof"

milestone V7_SOFTWARE_QUALIFIED:
  title "Software recovery, fsck, wear, and operation evidence accepted"

milestone V7_IMPLEMENTATION_100_PERCENT:
  title "v7 implementation 100 percent against the accepted scope"

milestone V7_NONPOWER_MEDIA_QUALIFIED:
  title "Non-power real-media behavior accepted with stated limitations"

milestone V7_RELEASE_SCOPE_AUTHORIZED:
  title "Exact release scope and untested limitation authorized"

milestone V7_RELEASE_READY:
  title "Implementation, non-power evidence, and authorization joined"

milestone V7_RELEASED_WITH_POWERLOSS_UNTESTED:
  title "v7 released with physical power-interruption behavior untested"

task V7_SCOPE_DECISION CURRENT_V7_BASELINE -> V7_COMPLETION_SCOPE_FIXED:
  title "Accept exact v7 operation, HRL, performance, and completion boundaries"
  description |
    Fix the operation set and exclusions, HRL and delayed-scan behavior,
    workload and latency budget, and evidence for 100 percent. Accepted
    raw-layout and recovery requirements remain authoritative.
  estimate:
    optimistic 1p
    most_likely 2p
    pessimistic 4p
  status blocked
  blocked_reason |
    The owner accepted the high-level finish, not the exact remaining
    operation surface, performance threshold, or completion evidence.
  owner "KAFS product owner and implementation stream"
  source "Owner v7 completion and release decision, 2026-09-17"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1

task V7_LOCAL_WRITE_PATH CURRENT_V7_BASELINE -> V7_LOCAL_WRITE_PATH_QUALIFIED:
  title "Replace repeated global normal-write work with proved local transitions"
  description |
    Address full-image validation, all-group journal analysis, repeated
    retirement proof, file-tree reachability, and group-summary rebuilds
    where measurement shows goal-relevant cost. Preserve journal, checkpoint,
    fsck, and recovery semantics and qualify on real-size geometry.
  estimate:
    optimistic 16p
    most_likely 32p
    pessimistic 64p
  status blocked
  blocked_reason |
    Workload and latency threshold, plus detection timing for unrelated
    corruption, remain undecided. Local WIP is not accepted evidence.
  owner "KAFS implementation stream"
  source "plans/v7-local-validation-20260917.pert; docs/kafs-v7-global-ops-audit-20260917.md"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1

task V7_HRL_DELAYED_SCAN V7_COMPLETION_SCOPE_FIXED -> V7_HRL_AND_DELAYED_SCAN_COMPLETE:
  title "Integrate v7-owned HRL write path and delayed scan with recovery proof"
  description |
    Connect HRL sharing and reclamation and delayed scan to the accepted
    layout, journal, and deterministic fsck contract. Re-estimate after the
    scope decision; this range is provisional.
  estimate:
    optimistic 16p
    most_likely 32p
    pessimistic 64p
  owner "KAFS implementation stream"
  source "docs/sd-card-wear-format-v7-inception-deck.md; docs/sd-card-wear-format-v7-raw-layout.md"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1

task V7_OPERATION_COVERAGE V7_COMPLETION_SCOPE_FIXED -> V7_OPERATION_SURFACE_COMPLETE:
  title "Complete the accepted v7 runtime and tool operation surface"
  description |
    Implement only the owner-accepted operation set, including required
    mutation, inspection, offline validation, and migration behavior.
    Unsupported operations fail closed, never through v5/v6 fallback.
    Re-estimate after the operation matrix is fixed.
  estimate:
    optimistic 16p
    most_likely 32p
    pessimistic 64p
  owner "KAFS implementation stream"
  source "docs/sd-card-wear-v7-capability-rebaseline-20260721.md; owner scope decision pending"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1

gate V7_LOCALITY_REQUIRED V7_LOCAL_WRITE_PATH_QUALIFIED -> V7_INTEGRATION_READY:
  reason "Normal-write locality with preserved recovery invariants is required"

gate V7_HRL_REQUIRED V7_HRL_AND_DELAYED_SCAN_COMPLETE -> V7_INTEGRATION_READY:
  reason "HRL and delayed scan remain on the v7 goal path"

gate V7_OPERATIONS_REQUIRED V7_OPERATION_SURFACE_COMPLETE -> V7_INTEGRATION_READY:
  reason "The accepted v7 operation set must be implemented"

gate V7_MIGRATION_REQUIRED MIGRATION_REHEARSAL_READY -> V7_INTEGRATION_READY:
  reason "Offline migration and rollback evidence remains required"

task V7_SOFTWARE_QUALIFICATION V7_INTEGRATION_READY -> V7_SOFTWARE_QUALIFIED:
  title "Qualify integrated software recovery, fsck, and wear behavior"
  description |
    Verify process-interruption replay, fsck, mutation, geometry, and wear
    placement against the completed implementation. Physical reader power
    interruption is not included.
  estimate:
    optimistic 8p
    most_likely 16p
    pessimistic 32p
  owner "KAFS validation stream"
  source "Accepted v7 inception and raw-layout contracts"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1

task V7_COMPLETION_REVIEW V7_SOFTWARE_QUALIFIED -> V7_IMPLEMENTATION_100_PERCENT:
  title "Independently accept v7 implementation 100 percent against exact scope"
  description |
    Reconcile accepted behavior with code, tools, tests, defects, and explicit
    exclusions. This is implementation completion, not release or a physical
    power-loss durability claim.
  estimate:
    optimistic 2p
    most_likely 4p
    pessimistic 8p
  owner "Independent KAFS reviewer"
  source "Owner v7 implementation 100 percent goal, 2026-09-17"
  requires:
    INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_STREAM 1

task V7_NONPOWER_REAL_MEDIA V7_IMPLEMENTATION_100_PERCENT -> V7_NONPOWER_MEDIA_QUALIFIED:
  title "Re-run and review bounded non-power real-media qualification"
  description |
    Re-run normal and process-stop cases on an exact approved target after
    write-path corrections, with offline fsck and readback. Retain the prior
    five-of-twelve interrupted run as diagnostic evidence, not a pass.
  estimate:
    optimistic 7p
    most_likely 13p
    pessimistic 26p
  owner "KAFS operator and independent reviewer"
  source "plans/v7-real-media-nonpower.pert; 2026-09-17 interrupted KINGMAX run"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1

task V7_RELEASE_AUTHORIZATION V7_IMPLEMENTATION_100_PERCENT -> V7_RELEASE_SCOPE_AUTHORIZED:
  title "Authorize exact release and disclose untested power-loss behavior"
  description |
    Decide version, channel, artifact, target audience, distribution route,
    and user-facing limitation. This plan edit grants no publication authority.
  estimate:
    optimistic 1p
    most_likely 2p
    pessimistic 4p
  status blocked
  blocked_reason |
    Exact release identity, channel, destination, and candidate-bound
    publication approval have not been provided.
  owner "KAFS release owner"
  source "Owner release-without-power-cut decision, 2026-09-17"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1

gate V7_MEDIA_REQUIRED V7_NONPOWER_MEDIA_QUALIFIED -> V7_RELEASE_READY:
  reason "Non-power real-media evidence is required for the release path"

gate V7_RELEASE_AUTH_REQUIRED V7_RELEASE_SCOPE_AUTHORIZED -> V7_RELEASE_READY:
  reason "A separate exact release authorization is required"

task V7_RELEASE V7_RELEASE_READY -> V7_RELEASED_WITH_POWERLOSS_UNTESTED:
  title "Publish and independently read back the authorized v7 release"
  description |
    Execute only the separately authorized candidate and route, then verify
    the artifact and disclosed physical power-loss limitation. Field incident
    response remains outside this release task.
  estimate:
    optimistic 2p
    most_likely 4p
    pessimistic 8p
  owner "KAFS release operator"
  source "Owner accepted final release goal, 2026-09-17; publication scope pending"
  requires:
    PRIMARY_STREAM 1
